; World sensor floor
;
; form/form-stdlib/world-sensor-floor.fk owns the sensor roster, afferent
; direction, inquiry plane, carrier inventory and shared reading/fusion shape.
; A description names a capability; supplied carrier names attest availability.
;
; observe/sensor-organ-template.fk owns feature routing and observed fusion.
; Each sensor supplies its name, plane, carrier and feature function. BML local
; functions and collection operations retain the context without copied walkers.
; observe/sensor-flow-run.bml runs motion, scene, context and room samples through
; these sources. It observes interpretation and routing, not physical acquisition.
;
; Live fusion signals completion, surprise and operation time through the shared
; organ-health framebuffer. Care correlates needs, offered resources, action and
; re-observation. Values remain in their owned reading; public events project
; operational metadata. See docs/live-dynamic-diagnostics.md.
;
; Host carriers own actual availability, acquisition, timestamps, confidence,
; outstanding work and release. Metal is admitted dynamically. Platform scope
; lives in hati-os-targets.fk and host-os-membrane.fk; the runtime direction and
; observed limits live in docs/fkwu-form-native-north-star.md and
; docs/fkwu-kernel-status.md.
